& [ConstructiveHemisphere]
  + pure correspondence keeps reference metadata attached to verified A6 lineage for audit and a later confidential seam
  + nested full A6 receipt exact order and independent replay preserve recoverability and inspection
& [AdversarialHemisphere]
  + references can smuggle paths URIs shell syntax log breaks credentials or authority-shaped language; reject dangerous shapes and never echo values
  + digest and byte count can launder belief in inaccessible material; describe them as metadata only
  + matched receipt can be confused with consent; keep permit presence and execution false
  + predecessor truncation can erase adverse state; require complete byte-identical A6 reconstruction
& [Synthesis]
